License:           Apache-2.0 OR GPL-2.0-or-later (dual; this project takes
                   Apache-2.0, so gpl = false). The upstream LICENSE text
                   (both licenses) is at ../LICENSE, extracted from the tarball.

The tarball is shipped pristine. The kernel build extracts include/ and
library/ from it at build time (M11 R8, CONFIG_TLS) and compiles a minimal
subset for x86_64-unknown-none; the repository therefore stores exactly the
upstream source. SHA256SUMS pins the archive and apps.lock pins the whole
vendored tree.
